---Raw form as given in template parameters.
---
---All numbers should be formatted as whole numbers with no separators
---(commas/underscores etc.) unless otherwise stated.
---@class RawForm
---@field ["Name"] string Name of unit.
---@field ["Base HP"] string Base HP (level 1, no treasures) of unit, numeric.
---Base attack. Should be a comma-separated list.
---(e.g. `"1680"` for a single hit, or `"1680,1680,1680"` for three-hit
---multihit) of the damage for each attack.
---@field ["Base AP"] string
---@field ["Range"] string Standing range; LD/Omni should only go in the
---abilities section.
---@field ["Foreswing"] string Time between attack starting and hits
---connecting, unit is frames. If unit has multihit, use a comma-separated list
---(e.g. `"5,10,20"` for Awakened Bahamut).
---@field ["Attack Cooldown"] string See Attack Timings page.
---@field ["Attack Length"] string Attack animation length, see Attack Timings
---page.
---@field ["Speed"] string Unit speed.
---@field ["KB"] string Amount of knockbacks before death.
---@field ["Cost"] string EoC chapter 1 cost of character.
---@field ["Recharge"] string Maximum recharge time of unit in frames.
---@field ["Attack Type"] string Single or Area Attack.
---@field ["Targets"] string? Enemies that the unit targets.
---@field ["Abilities"] string Unit's abilities.
---Level that stats should be shown at. Default is 30, except for Ultra Forms
---where it is 60. You can put + levels in (e.g. 1+30).
---@field ["Stats Level"] string?
---Yesno value for if the unit is a kamikaze unit.
---@field ["Kamikaze"] string?

